WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Paper stamp cards get lost in coat pockets.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.050
And loyalty apps? They die at the signup screen.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.600
Meet PassQR Loyalty.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.800
Customers scan the QR on your counter, tap once, and the card lands in Apple Wallet or Google Wallet.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.900
No app. No signup.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.200
Your staff stamp from any browser, and the card updates on their lock screen in about three seconds.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.700
No new hardware.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.000
Quiet Tuesday? Message every card holder at once.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.200
It lands on the card itself, not in a spam folder.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.100
PassQR Loyalty. Live in an afternoon. See it live today!
